{"content_hash": "5b95f4f31ce0fb24", "version_id": 992, "article_id": 100, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Beats and Pokémon team up for a special speaker", "title_zh": "Beats 和宝可梦联手推出特别版音箱", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "toodaylab", "source_url": "https://www.toodaylab.com/84293", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1610366398516-46da9dec5931?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8YmVhdHMlMjBkZXNrJTIwc2V0dXB8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5NDg4ODI4OHww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Amr Taha™ on Unsplash", "author": "Amr Taha™", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@amr_taha?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/black-flat-screen-computer-monitor-on-brown-wooden-desk-SMMqej67qjI?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(350, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(28, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "40a674dce8b1"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-17", "word_count": 170, "reading_minutes": 0.8, "lead": "Beats made a new version of its Pill speaker with Pokémon. It sold out fast, and now some people sell it for two or three times the price.", "lead_zh": "Beats 推出了一款和宝可梦联名的 Pill 音箱。它很快就卖光了，现在有人以两三倍的价格转卖。", "preview": "The special Beats Pill went on sale on October 13. You could only buy it on the Apple website and the Beats Douyin store. It sold out very q", "preview_zh": "这款特别版 Beats Pill 于 10 月 13 日开售。只能在苹果官网和 Beats 抖音官方旗舰店购买。它很快就卖光了。音箱正面有皮卡丘和谜拟丘，皮卡丘周围还有金属质感的闪电。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 975, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/100/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 51.65, "size_bytes": 310896, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 191, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/100/en_a2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 52.65, "size_bytes": 316800, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 191, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/100/en_a2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/100/en_a2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 56.175, "size_bytes": 337968, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 191, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/100/en_a2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/100/en_a2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 48.35, "size_bytes": 291024, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 191, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/100/en_a2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/100/en_a2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 51.825, "size_bytes": 311904, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 191, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/100/en_a2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8c427cb2/content/data/versions/992.json", "paragraphs": ["The special Beats Pill went on sale on October 13. You could only buy it on the Apple website and the Beats Douyin store. It sold out very quickly. The speaker has Pikachu and Mimikyu on the front, and metal lightning bolts around Pikachu.", "The box is special too. It has two sides, one for Pikachu and one for Mimikyu. You can fold their ears up to make the box stand. Inside, there is a strap with a Poké Ball and the Beats logo. This is the first Beats Pill with a charm on its strap.", "The speaker costs the same as the normal Beats Pill. It plays for 24 hours and you can use it near water. Beats says the two brands are both very famous. Now the speaker is hard to buy at its normal price. Some sellers ask two or three times more, so buyers should be careful.", "Many fans liked the design. Some people even made their own pictures of it with AI before the launch."], "paragraphs_zh": ["这款特别版 Beats Pill 于 10 月 13 日开售。只能在苹果官网和 Beats 抖音官方旗舰店购买。它很快就卖光了。音箱正面有皮卡丘和谜拟丘，皮卡丘周围还有金属质感的闪电。", "包装盒也很特别。它有两面，一面是皮卡丘，一面是谜拟丘。把耳朵翻起来，盒子就能立住。里面还有一条挂绳，上面有精灵球和 Beats 标志。这是 Beats Pill 第一次在挂绳上配挂饰。", "这款音箱和普通版 Beats Pill 价格一样。它能播放 24 小时，还能在靠近水的地方使用。Beats 说这两个品牌都很有名。现在很难用原价买到它。有些卖家要价两三倍，买家要小心。", "很多粉丝喜欢这个设计。发售前还有人用 AI 做了它的图片。这说明这次联名很受欢迎。"], "body": "The special Beats Pill went on sale on October 13. You could only buy it on the Apple website and the Beats Douyin store. It sold out very quickly. The speaker has Pikachu and Mimikyu on the front, and metal lightning bolts around Pikachu.\n\nThe box is special too. It has two sides, one for Pikachu and one for Mimikyu. You can fold their ears up to make the box stand. Inside, there is a strap with a Poké Ball and the Beats logo. This is the first Beats Pill with a charm on its strap.\n\nThe speaker costs the same as the normal Beats Pill. It plays for 24 hours and you can use it near water. Beats says the two brands are both very famous. Now the speaker is hard to buy at its normal price. Some sellers ask two or three times more, so buyers should be careful.\n\nMany fans liked the design. Some people even made their own pictures of it with AI before the launch.", "body_zh": "这款特别版 Beats Pill 于 10 月 13 日开售。只能在苹果官网和 Beats 抖音官方旗舰店购买。它很快就卖光了。音箱正面有皮卡丘和谜拟丘，皮卡丘周围还有金属质感的闪电。\n\n包装盒也很特别。它有两面，一面是皮卡丘，一面是谜拟丘。把耳朵翻起来，盒子就能立住。里面还有一条挂绳，上面有精灵球和 Beats 标志。这是 Beats Pill 第一次在挂绳上配挂饰。\n\n这款音箱和普通版 Beats Pill 价格一样。它能播放 24 小时，还能在靠近水的地方使用。Beats 说这两个品牌都很有名。现在很难用原价买到它。有些卖家要价两三倍，买家要小心。\n\n很多粉丝喜欢这个设计。发售前还有人用 AI 做了它的图片。这说明这次联名很受欢迎。", "text": "The special Beats Pill went on sale on October 13. You could only buy it on the Apple website and the Beats Douyin store. It sold out very quickly. The speaker has Pikachu and Mimikyu on the front, and metal lightning bolts around Pikachu. The box is special too. It has two sides, one for Pikachu and one for Mimikyu. You can fold their ears up to make the box stand. Inside, there is a strap with a Poké Ball and the Beats logo. This is the first Beats Pill with a charm on its strap. The speaker costs the same as the normal Beats Pill. It plays for 24 hours and you can use it near water. Beats says the two brands are both very famous. Now the speaker is hard to buy at its normal price. Some sellers ask two or three times more, so buyers should be careful. Many fans liked the design. Some people even made their own pictures of it with AI before the launch.", "vocab": [{"word": "sell out", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "卖光", "note": "常用短语，说商品很快卖完", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "special", "pos": "adj", "zh": "特别的", "note": "比普通版更特别", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "box", "pos": "noun", "zh": "盒子", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "strap", "pos": "noun", "zh": "挂绳", "note": "可以挂在背包上", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "price", "pos": "noun", "zh": "价格", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fan", "pos": "noun", "zh": "粉丝", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "design", "pos": "noun", "zh": "设计", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "careful", "pos": "adj", "zh": "小心的", "note": "be careful 要小心", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-17T04:04:45.682211", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.325, "sm": 250, "em": 325, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "special", "s": 0.325, "e": 0.675, "sm": 325, "em": 675, "cs": 4, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "Beats", "s": 0.675, "e": 0.95, "sm": 675, "em": 949, "cs": 12, "ce": 17, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "Pill", "s": 0.95, "e": 1.225, "sm": 950, "em": 1225, "cs": 18, "ce": 22, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "went", "s": 1.225, "e": 1.387, "sm": 1225, "em": 1387, "cs": 23, "ce": 27, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "on", "s": 1.387, "e": 1.587, "sm": 